{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NdwUZskgw9WKi3D2Xz8bYt","type":"tool_result","content":"# in-toto Page Content Analysis\n\n**What in-toto is:**\n\"A framework to secure the integrity of software supply chains\"\n\n**Problem it solves:**\n\"in-toto is designed to ensure the integrity of a software product from initiation to end-user installation. It does so by making it transparent to the user what steps were performed, by whom and in what order.\"\n\n**Supply chain layout, link metadata, steps/inspections:**\nNOT ON PAGE\n\n**CNCF project status:**\n\"in-toto is a CNCF graduated project.\""}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bf938bdb-ceb6-4379-83e1-38e2e5739719","uuid":"081a92fc-1090-4f96-8f49-b865a896f9e7","timestamp":"2026-08-31T04:25:44.480Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":16774,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# in-toto Page Content Analysis\n\n**What in-toto is:**\n\"A framework to secure the integrity of software supply chains\"\n\n**Problem it solves:**\n\"in-toto is designed to ensure the integrity of a software product from initiation to end-user installation. It does so by making it transparent to the user what steps were performed, by whom and in what order.\"\n\n**Supply chain layout, link metadata, steps/inspections:**\nNOT ON PAGE\n\n**CNCF project status:**\n\"in-toto is a CNCF graduated project.\"","durationMs":2284,"url":"https://in-toto.io/"}}
