{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012uxtVTmmbNz7Z3fkAjsXfy","type":"tool_result","content":"# Sigstore Container Signing: Tag Resolution and Security\n\nBased on the provided page content, here are my findings:\n\n**Tag resolution to digest:** NOT ON PAGE\n\n**Warning about tag mutability:** NOT ON PAGE\n\n**Recommendation to use digest references:** NOT ON PAGE\n\n**Signature storage location in registry:** NOT ON PAGE\n\nThe documentation page focuses on practical signing procedures (local keys, KMS integration, attestations, annotations) and signature management commands like `cosign tree` and `cosign clean`. However, it does not contain explicit statements about how cosign handles tag-to-digest resolution, security implications of tag mutability, or technical details about where signatures are stored relative to image digests in the registry."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bf938bdb-ceb6-4379-83e1-38e2e5739719","uuid":"af21d1de-e7f0-4e92-848d-1317007414f3","timestamp":"2026-08-31T04:30:49.632Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":66677,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Sigstore Container Signing: Tag Resolution and Security\n\nBased on the provided page content, here are my findings:\n\n**Tag resolution to digest:** NOT ON PAGE\n\n**Warning about tag mutability:** NOT ON PAGE\n\n**Recommendation to use digest references:** NOT ON PAGE\n\n**Signature storage location in registry:** NOT ON PAGE\n\nThe documentation page focuses on practical signing procedures (local keys, KMS integration, attestations, annotations) and signature management commands like `cosign tree` and `cosign clean`. However, it does not contain explicit statements about how cosign handles tag-to-digest resolution, security implications of tag mutability, or technical details about where signatures are stored relative to image digests in the registry.","durationMs":3156,"url":"https://docs.sigstore.dev/cosign/signing/signing_with_containers/"}}
