{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01W9FPagsYkpi1y8CFKTMvVH","type":"tool_result","content":"# Container Image Verification Queries\n\nBased on my review of the provided Sigstore documentation page, here are the findings:\n\n**Verifying by digest rather than by tag:** NOT ON PAGE\n\n**Warning about tag mutability/insecurity of tag-based verification:** NOT ON PAGE\n\n**Cosign resolving tags to digests:** NOT ON PAGE\n\n**Where signatures live in the registry relative to image digest:** NOT ON PAGE\n\nThe documentation page focuses on verification command syntax and procedures (keyless verification, local verification, attestation verification, etc.) but does not explicitly address these specific topics regarding digest-based verification, tag mutability concerns, tag resolution mechanisms, or signature storage location details in the registry."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bf938bdb-ceb6-4379-83e1-38e2e5739719","uuid":"dcdde5c5-e6b4-4a33-98bf-19a6d66f49d9","timestamp":"2026-08-31T04:31:43.469Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":73554,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Container Image Verification Queries\n\nBased on my review of the provided Sigstore documentation page, here are the findings:\n\n**Verifying by digest rather than by tag:** NOT ON PAGE\n\n**Warning about tag mutability/insecurity of tag-based verification:** NOT ON PAGE\n\n**Cosign resolving tags to digests:** NOT ON PAGE\n\n**Where signatures live in the registry relative to image digest:** NOT ON PAGE\n\nThe documentation page focuses on verification command syntax and procedures (keyless verification, local verification, attestation verification, etc.) but does not explicitly address these specific topics regarding digest-based verification, tag mutability concerns, tag resolution mechanisms, or signature storage location details in the registry.","durationMs":2771,"url":"https://docs.sigstore.dev/cosign/verifying/verify/"}}
