{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014D65PbF7GY8WvyxLdPCMDp","type":"tool_result","content":"# Notary Project Documentation: Signature and Digest Statements\n\n**Signature bound to digest rather than tag:**\n\"Notation resolves the tag to the digest before signing if a tag is used to identify the container image.\"\n\n**Warning about tag mutability and tag-based signing:**\n\"Always reference and use the image digest instead of a tag since digest is immutable.\"\n\n**Signature storage in registry:**\nNOT ON PAGE\n\nThe documentation emphasizes using digests for signing and verification but does not explicitly describe the technical mechanism of how signatures are stored in the registry and linked to the subject artifact's digest."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bf938bdb-ceb6-4379-83e1-38e2e5739719","uuid":"7a4209b0-9f6f-45f0-8925-39b2917de054","timestamp":"2026-08-31T04:31:46.791Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":52462,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Notary Project Documentation: Signature and Digest Statements\n\n**Signature bound to digest rather than tag:**\n\"Notation resolves the tag to the digest before signing if a tag is used to identify the container image.\"\n\n**Warning about tag mutability and tag-based signing:**\n\"Always reference and use the image digest instead of a tag since digest is immutable.\"\n\n**Signature storage in registry:**\nNOT ON PAGE\n\nThe documentation emphasizes using digests for signing and verification but does not explicitly describe the technical mechanism of how signatures are stored in the registry and linked to the subject artifact's digest.","durationMs":3255,"url":"https://notaryproject.dev/docs/quickstart-guides/quickstart-sign-image-artifact/"}}
