{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MKTbnNupBHAGCLT8ruDaFX","type":"tool_result","content":"# Security and Supply Chain Related Glossary Terms\n\nBased on the index page, here are the terms relating to security or the supply chain:\n\n1. **Cloud Native Security** — `/cloud-native-security/`\n2. **DevSecOps** — `/devsecops/`\n3. **Digital Certificate** — `/digital-certificate/`\n4. **Mutual Transport Layer Security (mTLS)** — `/mutual-transport-layer-security/`\n5. **Policy as Code (PaC)** — `/policy-as-code/`\n6. **Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)** — `/role-based-access-control/`\n7. **Security Chaos Engineering** — `/security-chaos-engineering/`\n8. **Transport Layer Security (TLS)** — `/transport-layer-security/`\n9. **Zero Trust Architecture** — `/zero-trust-architecture/`\n\nThese nine terms directly address security hardening, access control, cryptographic protocols, policy enforcement, or trust frameworks within cloud-native environments."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bf938bdb-ceb6-4379-83e1-38e2e5739719","uuid":"27aa46a9-2a44-4d3a-a616-5ae4eea7b810","timestamp":"2026-08-31T04:32:06.557Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":47427,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Security and Supply Chain Related Glossary Terms\n\nBased on the index page, here are the terms relating to security or the supply chain:\n\n1. **Cloud Native Security** — `/cloud-native-security/`\n2. **DevSecOps** — `/devsecops/`\n3. **Digital Certificate** — `/digital-certificate/`\n4. **Mutual Transport Layer Security (mTLS)** — `/mutual-transport-layer-security/`\n5. **Policy as Code (PaC)** — `/policy-as-code/`\n6. **Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)** — `/role-based-access-control/`\n7. **Security Chaos Engineering** — `/security-chaos-engineering/`\n8. **Transport Layer Security (TLS)** — `/transport-layer-security/`\n9. **Zero Trust Architecture** — `/zero-trust-architecture/`\n\nThese nine terms directly address security hardening, access control, cryptographic protocols, policy enforcement, or trust frameworks within cloud-native environments.","durationMs":3018,"url":"https://glossary.cncf.io/"}}
